{
 "_comment": "Uncontracted questions ('Vilt þú ...?') that sound stiff or translated. Everyday Icelandic writes 'Viltu ...?'. Format: see README. basis: native = recent Icelandic text backs the rule (counts in rules/evidence.json); house = the product owner's decision; grammar = standard spelling and grammar.",
 "group": "contraction",
